[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11000100_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11000100_02_0010","text":"辛苦了，智代子"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11000100_02_0020","text":"辛苦了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11000100_02_0030","text":"排练结束后的感想，\n能对着镜头说几句吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11000100_02_0040","text":"好的！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11000100_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11000100_02_0050","text":"那我要开始了——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11000100_02_0060","text":"正在看视频的各位！\n大家好！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11000100_02_0070","text":"放学后CLIMAX GIRLS、\n巧克力偶像的园田智代子！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11000100_02_0080","text":"目前，283事务所全员参加的Live的排练已经结束──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11000100_02_0090","text":"已经完成得非常非常棒了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11000100_02_0100","text":"我一定会让大家尽兴的\n请！　期待吧！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11000100_02_0002","text":"Motion"}]
